        {
          "id": "f53ff821-04a8-3f3b-adca-dd1c220d1035",
          "content": {
            "id": "f53ff821-04a8-3f3b-adca-dd1c220d1035",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Why B. Riley Financial's Stock Is Soaring Today",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Shares of the investment bank B. Riley Financial (NASDAQ: RILY) had exploded nearly 19% higher at 10:30 a.m. ET today after the company announced that it had secured new debt financing.  It's been a tumultuous few years for B. Riley, which has been the subject of multiple short reports and an investigation by the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC).  B. Riley had to delay submitting SEC filings.",
            "pubDate": "2025-02-27T16:04:01Z",
            "displayTime": "2025-02-27T16:04:01Z",
